          "rationale": "Portable transport-context confirmation after actual comparison of all exact before/proposed Goal/P inputs, unchanged substantive decision/nativeproposal fields, all explicit condition bindings and the new P candidate-owner context. This is not another independent whole-five scientific review. Prior own content judgment and the separate new P/Kind quality opinion remain attributed and unchanged. The complete P requires sinusoidal differentiation with frequency/phase transfer and physical voltage interpretation, plus smooth nonsinusoidal graph slopes and a corner/differentiability audit. The explicit cosine-flux brief makes transformed trigonometric differentiation unavoidable across this entire P even though some individual graph/pulse tasks avoid it. The Math edge addresses that branch without pretending to cover all smooth-function calculus. A constant or linear flux is an allowed easier case, not a replacement for the explicit sinusoidal case and frequency/phase variation.3401d95d lacks innerω, and an average ΔΦ/Δt from direct Physics eb1ea150 cannot in general replace dΦ/dt or recover phase. The full58d2f963 negative-inner-factor, phase and constant-limit checks are the same derivative mechanism; a whole general calculus course would be broader.58d2f963 does not by itself certify polynomial derivative algorithms, arbitrary pulse differentiability or all physical interpretation; those obligations remain. With eb1ea150 mastered and58d2f963 unknown, current direct gating opens; adding58d2f963 blocks. If58d2f963 is mastered while deeper graphical/basic/parameter Math goals are unknown, the direct gate opens and does not certify or backfill those skills. Any resulting source/placement/route gap remains real.",
